    state.messages,
    systemPrompt: state.systemPrompt,
    tools: state.tools,
  );

  /// Builds the [AutoCompactor] and runs it. Hosts that want to
  /// inspect the compactor before starting (e.g. for logging) can use
  /// [build] instead.
