```

This was the last terminal path that left the host bracket open — the CLI's `_AutoCompactorCliHooks.onDone` now fires `compactionEnd(...)` and clears `_runTokensBefore` on this path too, so the next compaction's freed-delta frame is no longer computed against the failed run's before-count (and the failed `onPass` prints a diagnostic only, never a success-looking report).

